  "claim_boundary": "Passing this contract makes a result technically eligible for an explicit admission decision. It does not guarantee a sleeve, future performance, the target Sharpe, or the target drawdown. Point estimates cannot override confidence-bound, crisis-conditional, tail-loss, execution-evidence, or capacity-reconciliation failures. v5 additionally rejects any book whose permitted correlation ceiling is inconsistent with the stated portfolio objective, and gates the drawdown objective at expected maximum drawdown while requiring the 95th percentile to be published unsmoothed.",
